 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsLXmocky5kQ7kNvwHoIxEZ&_nc_oc=AdqnfmV2_fknZGeqAlx7Qwh4CM93FbP5kWBbh2gncpUBimpin_6-5q9ZCrtuOIlkl_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGgHgeYoRgtWhX73FtBaWPYPcf10BOMILUR4VRX5gIpAQ&oe=6A7202C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HNUrcPwxgVUQ7kNvwGQ0S3I&_nc_oc=AdqhvxCISDEb0ZB0UTFviXID9XnddrBz02EYYyZBDOqMC0h1oGxGTduWJD_9A8OsUMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEEuPVl8VByO9rMyqNf9mFtXjSfchemP65Ru_mITSPpuw&oe=6A71D7E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HGlnyqstf2kQ7kNvwH6dO45&_nc_oc=Ado0BArFf_3GNq34NumZK1qQ-sDHGJ_Yw9Q1ihow5omu-xCA1c08TmEQ9fIEE8lqfsc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEHTnPcud1zhgETyx5EEZpMEz02EkEX6Vq4S5wGg6pW2w&oe=6A71E1DC"}, {"fil